# Step 0.4 probe (dev only). Run `bun run dev`, then send requests with the VS Code
# "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client) or copy them into curl.
@base = http://localhost:3000/api/dev/probe

### Success envelope + X-Request-Id header  → 200
GET {{base}}/ok

### Incoming request id is echoed back  → 200, X-Request-Id: my-trace-12345
GET {{base}}/ok
X-Request-Id: my-trace-12345

### Valid body  → 201
POST {{base}}/validation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Rocket", "size": 4 }

### Schema failure  → 400 VALIDATION_FAILED with details
POST {{base}}/validation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "R", "size": 99 }

### Malformed JSON  → 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
POST {{base}}/validation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Rocket",

### Wrong content type  → 415 UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA_TYPE
POST {{base}}/validation
Content-Type: text/plain

hello

### Business error  → 403 FORBIDDEN
GET {{base}}/app-error

### Unexpected error  → 500 INTERNAL, generic message (details only in the server log)
GET {{base}}/crash

### Unique violation, unmapped  → 409 CONFLICT (generic message)
GET {{base}}/unique

### Unique violation, mapped by constraint name  → 409 with the flow's message
GET {{base}}/unique-mapped

### CHECK violation  → 500 (safety net caught a bug; logged as error)
GET {{base}}/check

### Deferred FK fails at COMMIT  → 500 (logged with atCommit=true)
GET {{base}}/deferred-fk

### Lock wait > lock_timeout  → 503 RETRY_LATER after ~DATABASE_LOCK_TIMEOUT_MS, Retry-After: 1
GET {{base}}/lock-timeout

### Events published after COMMIT  → 200; log shows "event published" after "before COMMIT"
GET {{base}}/events

### Rolled back  → 409; log shows NO "event published"
GET {{base}}/events-rollback

### Read snapshot  → 200 { isolation: "repeatable read", readOnly: "on" }
GET {{base}}/snapshot

### Write inside a read snapshot  → 500 (25006, a bug)
GET {{base}}/snapshot-write

### Unknown case  → 400 VALIDATION_FAILED (path parameter)
GET {{base}}/nope

### Unknown API path  → 404 NOT_FOUND in the error envelope
GET http://localhost:3000/api/does-not-exist
